WEBVTT

00:14.810 --> 00:17.120
What’s up with this busted ship?

00:17.480 --> 00:18.560
Wait up, Warin.

00:18.560 --> 00:21.080
Calm down. What are you doing?

00:21.080 --> 00:22.660
Isn’t it obvious?

00:22.660 --> 00:24.420
I’m going to save Marin and Urin.

00:24.770 --> 00:26.060
Don’t be reckless.

00:26.060 --> 00:30.150
Even if you’re worried, you should wait at home for them to return.

00:30.150 --> 00:32.510
But this has been going on for days.

00:32.510 --> 00:35.540
What if they’ve been attacked with fearsome weapons?

00:36.190 --> 00:40.070
What kind of hideous situation would they be facing now?

00:40.070 --> 00:42.180
Don’t you feel it, Sam?

00:44.850 --> 00:46.200
Feel?

00:46.200 --> 00:47.940
An unpleasant aura.

00:47.940 --> 00:49.930
Ever since Marin and Urin have been up there,

00:49.930 --> 00:51.900
something weird has been going on in the sea.

00:52.330 --> 00:54.050
This is a premonition.

01:11.250 --> 01:13.800
kimi to ireba

01:11.250 --> 01:13.800
If I’m with you -

01:13.800 --> 01:16.630
kimi to itara

01:13.800 --> 01:16.630
because I’m with you -

01:16.630 --> 01:21.260
kokoro ga yasuraku

01:16.630 --> 01:21.260
my heart is at ease.

01:22.220 --> 01:24.810
kimi mo soude

01:22.220 --> 01:24.810
Surely, you’re the same.

01:24.810 --> 01:30.360
kimi mo ima yasurakerute

01:24.810 --> 01:30.360
You’re at ease now, too.

01:31.400 --> 01:37.990
itekuretara ii noni

01:31.400 --> 01:37.990
If you can just admit it,

01:39.740 --> 01:43.330
sono mama

01:39.740 --> 01:43.330
for even time to forget us,

01:44.250 --> 01:57.470
jikan saemo wasuresouna kurai shizen dakara

01:44.250 --> 01:57.470
it’s only natural, at this rate.

01:58.220 --> 02:08.940
yubisaki kara koboreochiru violet wo yo

01:58.220 --> 02:08.940
Violet drops, falling slowly from our fingertips…

02:08.940 --> 02:15.820
chiisana yume egaite yukou

02:08.940 --> 02:15.820
“Let us follow that small dream with a smile!”

02:15.820 --> 02:21.740
futaride sasayaka na

02:15.820 --> 02:21.740
And just like that, we are happy

02:23.160 --> 02:27.370
kotoba ga ureshii

02:23.160 --> 02:27.370
over such trifling words

02:27.870 --> 02:32.080
somatteku sora

02:27.870 --> 02:32.080
that paint the sky.

02:48.390 --> 02:52.860
Trial for One's Heart

03:03.240 --> 03:05.070
There are so many different sounds.

03:05.860 --> 03:07.620
Yup, it is somewhat interesting.

03:07.620 --> 03:08.910
It is a bit noisy, though.

03:09.250 --> 03:11.610
Water has lots of different sounds!

03:11.610 --> 03:15.340
At this rate, the sky should be able to fill up to become the sea.

03:16.730 --> 03:19.120
What are you guys selfishly saying?

03:19.120 --> 03:20.570
Ah, Kanon-chan.

03:20.570 --> 03:22.260
Is it okay if I open this just a little?

03:23.380 --> 03:25.180
Isn’t it obvious that you can’t?

03:25.710 --> 03:26.420
Selfish.

03:27.660 --> 03:30.140
The sea and the sky are both fun. I like them both.

03:30.800 --> 03:34.560
I hate this sea and this island.

03:36.030 --> 03:39.120
Oh, why? They’re so wonderful.

03:39.120 --> 03:40.570
How so?

03:40.570 --> 03:42.860
In the first place, there are things hidden in the sea that can attack you,

03:42.860 --> 03:47.240
causing you to come back with your legs injured; it is apparent that there are floating, dangerous objects.

03:47.240 --> 03:53.290
How is that a pleasant vacation? Date? Youth? It’s totally an illusion!

03:53.290 --> 03:55.040
Kanon-chan…

03:56.820 --> 03:57.960
The sea…

03:59.040 --> 04:03.800
Since I was little, I’ve not once had a pleasant memory of it.

04:03.800 --> 04:05.390
Besides…

04:15.640 --> 04:17.980
You can hold on to this for now.

04:18.910 --> 04:20.410
I really can’t!

04:20.410 --> 04:24.610
This is a precious gift to Kanon-chan from "Flounder," isn’t it?

04:24.610 --> 04:27.610
It’s not “Flounder,” it’s boyfriend. <i>Ex</i>-boyfriend.

04:27.610 --> 04:30.140
Whether it’s an Ex-boyfriend or a Flounder…

04:30.140 --> 04:31.150
Like I said…

04:31.150 --> 04:32.560
I’ll hold on to it.

04:33.470 --> 04:34.530
Urin!

04:36.130 --> 04:40.380
It’s all right. It’s precious, so I won’t lose it.

04:44.950 --> 04:46.760
What’s with her?

04:53.890 --> 04:56.870
In order to seal Sedona again,

04:56.870 --> 05:01.940
the sky girl must reach 100% purity quickly.

05:02.780 --> 05:04.630
Since it’s come down to this…

05:25.850 --> 05:26.540
Huh?

05:26.970 --> 05:28.730
A treasure map?

05:28.730 --> 05:30.050
That’s right.

05:30.480 --> 05:40.850
Once you travel there to get it, if your heart is unwavering, it will mean that it is pure, and the treasure will reveal itself.

05:40.850 --> 05:42.980
In other words, you’re asking me to find it?

05:43.620 --> 05:45.860
It’s your freedom to do so.

05:46.790 --> 05:49.430
This is... Kagero Island?

05:49.430 --> 05:52.150
Doesn’t it look like the caves of Kagero Island?

05:52.150 --> 05:57.790
It’s a total maze inside. Without the map, you will never find your way in.

05:59.630 --> 06:01.270
It looks fishy…

06:01.270 --> 06:01.960
What?!

06:02.710 --> 06:04.380
Are you going or not?!

06:07.370 --> 06:08.770
I understand.

06:08.770 --> 06:10.430
It’s okay if I find it, isn’t it?

06:10.430 --> 06:11.740
<i>If</i>
I find it, that is.

06:11.740 --> 06:13.480
A treasure map?

06:13.480 --> 06:15.160
It looks interesting.

06:16.270 --> 06:20.060
Kanon-chan, I’ll go too.

06:20.460 --> 06:22.510
Huh? Why?

06:22.510 --> 06:26.060
Let’s work hard with our combined priestess powers!

06:23.570 --> 06:25.570
Got it covered, eh...

06:27.530 --> 06:30.490
It can’t be helped. I’ll go too.

06:35.410 --> 06:38.700
Kanon-chan, where do we eat our lunches?

06:38.700 --> 06:40.120
You made and brought lunches for us?

06:41.470 --> 06:43.380
Even though it's not a picnic...

06:45.610 --> 06:49.570
Why? Why am I the only one left behind?

06:49.570 --> 06:50.340
It can’t be helped.

06:50.340 --> 06:54.730
It is a place in which you cannot set foot.

07:08.580 --> 07:12.220
Why can’t it be me?

07:16.710 --> 07:18.150
This is weird.

07:18.150 --> 07:22.380
According to the map, there should be a path on our left.

07:22.380 --> 07:27.660
Let’s see. Sea cucumber is held on the right, so starfish should be held on the left...

07:27.660 --> 07:29.880
No, I’m not sure about that…

07:32.180 --> 07:33.130
Wait!

07:37.480 --> 07:38.670
Are you okay?

07:41.020 --> 07:42.250
I’m fine.

07:56.190 --> 07:59.410
Oh, Urin-chan. Where are you going in that get up?

08:01.160 --> 08:03.610
I’m going to explore Kagero Island a little.

08:03.610 --> 08:04.810
Kagero Island?

08:04.810 --> 08:08.130
Yes. Keep it a secret from the elder, okay?

08:08.710 --> 08:12.970
It’s okay to explore, but be careful when entering the caves.

08:13.570 --> 08:20.730
The caves there flood with sea water when the tides come. If you’re not good with caves, you’ll be drowned.

08:21.790 --> 08:27.860
Oh. Be careful of the curse, too.

08:28.520 --> 08:34.010
There are legends of Kagero Island being a place where pirates once hid their treasure.

08:34.010 --> 08:41.290
Even now, it’s rumored that the phantoms of pirates still linger and use their curses to kill anyone who comes near.

08:41.900 --> 08:44.960
A curse that ends life?

08:45.460 --> 08:46.820
Or not.

08:46.820 --> 08:49.460
It’s just a legend.

08:49.460 --> 08:51.380
A simple, little rumor.

08:57.850 --> 08:59.680
That was fun!

08:59.680 --> 09:02.390
That was not fun! I thought I was going to die.

09:02.390 --> 09:04.770
Plus, we don’t know where we are.

09:07.880 --> 09:09.110
What is it this time?

09:12.120 --> 09:16.490
There’s somebody else here.

09:17.250 --> 09:19.180
You don’t have to come!

09:19.180 --> 09:21.120
No! I’m definitely coming.

09:21.770 --> 09:25.870
What am I going to do if Onee-san gets cursed and killed by the phantom pirates?

09:26.180 --> 09:27.750
I don’t know a thing about that,

09:27.750 --> 09:33.340
but I can’t let the Sky Priestess fail to get the treasure and have her heart turn to darkness.

09:33.340 --> 09:36.050
Shouldn’t you have just gone and retrieved it in the first place?

09:36.050 --> 09:40.260
The treasure that I spoke of…

09:43.260 --> 09:46.550
Wow, it’s beautiful. What's that light?

10:03.200 --> 10:08.420
What is this? This place isn’t marked on the turtle’s map.

10:09.160 --> 10:10.670
Kanon-chan, that…

10:14.550 --> 10:17.440
That's a pirate ship.

10:17.440 --> 10:20.040
Could it be that the treasure the turtle mentioned is

10:20.040 --> 10:22.230
hidden pirate treasure?

10:22.230 --> 10:27.130
If I had that kind of money, I wouldn’t need to part-time as a fortune teller!

10:27.130 --> 10:28.120
Kanon-chan.

10:28.120 --> 10:31.810
That’s not the point. There’s nothing pure about that.

10:31.810 --> 10:33.910
I can’t have such greedy desires,

10:33.910 --> 10:40.410
but when I report it and turn it over to the police, they’ll claim that it’s mine since I found it.

10:40.410 --> 10:42.070
Kanon-chan…

10:42.370 --> 10:43.790
Here! Here!

10:43.790 --> 10:45.750
Let’s eat our lunch here!

10:45.750 --> 10:47.120
Over there?!

10:49.320 --> 10:52.040
Huh. It looks surprisingly delicious.

10:52.390 --> 10:54.170
Eat up!

11:02.420 --> 11:03.840
Seaweed?

11:04.670 --> 11:06.990
Or would you prefer this fujitsu ball?

11:06.990 --> 11:09.050
Seaweed is fine.

11:15.410 --> 11:19.670
You seem to be accustomed to our way of life.

11:19.670 --> 11:21.700
Is it okay that you haven’t returned to the sea?

11:23.030 --> 11:26.620
As long as I have this Mercator Ring, I can breathe the air.

11:28.270 --> 11:35.000
I wonder if you have to go back once I reach 100% purity.

11:35.520 --> 11:39.420
Not sure. It’ll be fine even if you don’t rush things.

11:39.420 --> 11:43.970
I think you’ll do fine even if you don’t get the elder’s treasure.

12:08.880 --> 12:10.450
Eh? Marin?

12:12.420 --> 12:13.600
Warin!

12:13.600 --> 12:14.840
Yo, Marin.

12:14.840 --> 12:16.170
Sam!

12:16.170 --> 12:17.790
Marin!

12:18.090 --> 12:19.270
Warin!

12:20.600 --> 12:23.360
What a surprise. I thought you were in a bad situation.

12:23.360 --> 12:25.390
Why are you in such a place?

12:25.880 --> 12:30.310
I was worried about Marin, so I decided to come find you by using a Mercator Ring.

12:30.310 --> 12:34.390
We took shelter in this cave during the storm last night, but we got lost.

12:34.390 --> 12:37.910
It’s good that you’re okay, Marin. Same goes for her.

12:38.860 --> 12:42.780
How can it still sparkle in this cave?

12:43.270 --> 12:46.130
So, this is the bad sky person.

12:46.130 --> 12:47.000
Where’s Urin?

12:47.000 --> 12:50.690
This person is Kanon-chan. Urin is at Kanon’s house.

12:51.460 --> 12:53.210
Urin’s a hostage?!

12:53.210 --> 12:56.810
You’re mistaken. The sky people are not scary at all.

12:56.810 --> 12:59.120
Besides, Kanon-chan is a friend.

12:59.120 --> 13:01.710
Is that so? Then, nice to meet you.

13:08.220 --> 13:10.430
Priestess of the Sea and Priestess of the Sky?

13:10.920 --> 13:16.540
In order to seal Sedona away again, both our powers are needed.

13:16.540 --> 13:18.410
She is a priestess?

13:19.210 --> 13:21.820
What’s with that glare? You got a problem with me?

13:21.820 --> 13:27.090
Anyway, be it Sedona or Priestesses, such things are unbelievable.

13:27.090 --> 13:30.110
Marin, you’re being tricked by this sky person.

13:30.110 --> 13:32.770
Why would I lie to her?

13:32.770 --> 13:35.530
If you think I’m lying, just ask the turtle.

13:35.530 --> 13:36.400
Turtle?

13:36.400 --> 13:38.480
Yup, Matsumoto of the turtles.

13:38.480 --> 13:41.710
He sent me here to look for some treasure.

13:43.010 --> 13:46.130
I’m the one who’s caught up in this inconvenience.

13:46.490 --> 13:48.090
Kanon-chan…

13:50.210 --> 13:52.600
So, are we going to look for the treasure or not?

13:52.860 --> 13:56.310
You can’t go, Marin. You’ll be taken advantage of this time.

13:57.580 --> 14:02.980
You’re only planning to use Marin and run when you obtain the treasure, aren’t you?

14:03.270 --> 14:09.160
As I said, you’re wrong. Besides, she’s the one who selfishly tagged along.

14:09.160 --> 14:12.080
Whoever said to go together wasn’t me.

14:12.080 --> 14:13.120
Kanon-chan…

14:13.120 --> 14:14.830
Marin is like this, that’s why…

14:15.260 --> 14:17.030
You know that…

14:17.030 --> 14:21.170
Warin, stop it. Kanon-chan is not a bad person at all.

14:22.370 --> 14:24.390
You’re on the sky people’s side?

14:26.270 --> 14:28.910
I should have known that the sky people are fearsome.

14:28.910 --> 14:32.980
Since it’s come to this, I’ll have to use force to bring Marin back.

14:32.980 --> 14:35.560
Please, both of you, stop.

14:35.560 --> 14:37.340
It’s just as Marin said.

14:37.340 --> 14:38.730
The two of you shouldn’t fight.

14:39.230 --> 14:46.700
It’s true that she gives off a bit of an evil aura, but such a cute girl wouldn’t lie to Marin.

14:46.700 --> 14:47.180
Right?

14:49.470 --> 14:53.410
Would you like to eat sea grapes with me?

15:00.420 --> 15:07.550
Regardless of which people it is, you think you can touch and have your way with girls as you please!

15:08.470 --> 15:10.130
No, I wouldn’t go that far…

15:10.130 --> 15:12.500
You’re using your fingers for it all?

15:13.560 --> 15:16.610
This is all the guy’s fault!

15:16.610 --> 15:18.980
What does she mean, fingers?

15:22.970 --> 15:25.920
Once again, Kanon-chan is delusional.

15:25.920 --> 15:27.360
Offer it to me.

15:42.670 --> 15:45.290
You’re cute too. Should we…

15:48.540 --> 15:52.390
Offer your evil soul to Sedona-sama.

15:52.970 --> 15:54.050
Again?

15:54.380 --> 15:56.930
Kanon-chan! This is Sedona’s power.

15:57.390 --> 15:58.340
Sedona?

15:58.890 --> 16:00.810
Do not interfere with me!

16:05.970 --> 16:06.860
Go!

16:10.270 --> 16:11.270
Kanon-chan!

16:20.080 --> 16:24.330
O light of the pure sea, heed my calls. Diminish the darkness!

16:28.320 --> 16:29.000
Me too…

16:29.300 --> 16:31.940
Transform…

16:33.550 --> 16:34.630
I can’t.

16:34.630 --> 16:36.950
It’s because I let out all my evil aura just now.

16:36.950 --> 16:39.470
It’s all because of that guy!

16:38.280 --> 16:39.470
Onee-chan!

16:39.800 --> 16:43.310
Urin! It’s dangerous. Stay away.

16:45.830 --> 16:46.690
This is…

16:47.120 --> 16:50.150
Sedona’s power is overflowing.

16:50.720 --> 16:54.110
Urin? And this is the turtle elder?

16:55.670 --> 16:58.530
Which means Marin was telling the truth...

17:02.160 --> 17:03.250
Look out!

17:25.700 --> 17:29.140
I have to transform!

17:29.140 --> 17:30.750
Why are you just standing there?

17:30.750 --> 17:32.720
You’re a Priestess too.

17:32.720 --> 17:33.740
Please, fight!

17:33.740 --> 17:38.050
Shut up. Why do I have to follow your orders?

17:38.910 --> 17:41.070
Wait… Why?

18:06.490 --> 18:07.740
What are you doing?

18:07.740 --> 18:10.290
Hurry and take off the Mercator Ring.

18:14.360 --> 18:15.520
Watch out!

18:27.720 --> 18:29.900
Marin, hurry up and run!

18:29.900 --> 18:32.000
I can’t. I need to save Kanon-chan.

18:32.780 --> 18:37.190
O light of the pure sea, heed my calls. Diminish the darkness!

18:40.300 --> 18:41.440
You can’t!

18:43.990 --> 18:45.100
Kanon-chan!

18:52.760 --> 18:53.730
Marin, you…

18:54.200 --> 18:55.900
Let go of her.

18:57.150 --> 18:59.080
Warin, thank you.

18:59.660 --> 19:04.700
Seriously, why do you have to save everyone?

19:07.480 --> 19:10.670
If you lay a hand on Marin, I will never forgive you.

19:12.220 --> 19:18.050
I see. That girl likes Marin too.

19:18.600 --> 19:20.100
She loves Marin.

19:39.000 --> 19:40.680
Kanon-chan!

19:41.850 --> 19:44.070
Thanks, Marin.

19:44.070 --> 19:45.120
Turtle, the flame!

19:49.830 --> 19:53.880
O light of the pure sky, heed my call. Diminish the darkness!

20:21.280 --> 20:22.420
Kanon-chan.

21:00.020 --> 21:01.010
Thank you.

21:01.010 --> 21:02.850
I love you.

21:08.780 --> 21:12.030
Thus, we did not find the turtle’s treasure.

21:12.030 --> 21:17.460
It was an exchange diary I kept with Fukushima-san that I hid in the past.

21:17.460 --> 21:19.210
Huh? Fukushima-san?

21:19.500 --> 21:22.100
My first turtle love.

21:22.100 --> 21:29.960
If you’d have read that pure exchange diary, you would have a pure heart, like mine.

21:32.020 --> 21:33.800
Then again, you guys…

21:33.800 --> 21:36.340
Well then, we’ll be returning to the sea, okay?

21:36.900 --> 21:37.970
Thanks.

21:37.970 --> 21:39.730
Take care, Warin.

21:40.390 --> 21:45.650
Priestess of the Sky, I’ll leave Marin and Urin in your care.

21:43.790 --> 21:47.610
Are you listening?

22:26.650 --> 22:31.570
hikari no yurikago

22:26.650 --> 22:31.570
Within a droplet of water,

22:31.990 --> 22:35.120
shizuku no naka ni

22:31.990 --> 22:35.120
a cradle of light

22:35.450 --> 22:38.370
tojikometara

22:35.450 --> 22:38.370
is trapped.

22:38.370 --> 22:43.550
mizu no iro ni naru

22:38.370 --> 22:43.550
And so, it colors the water.

22:43.960 --> 22:47.170
mimi wo sumashite

22:43.960 --> 22:47.170
Clear your ears

22:47.170 --> 22:49.840
eien e

22:47.170 --> 22:49.760
to eternity.

22:49.840 --> 22:55.140
hitori de yume no ato

22:49.930 --> 22:55.140
Beyond a lonely dream,

22:55.140 --> 23:00.480
tsunaide yukeba

22:55.140 --> 23:00.480
if one connects with another,

23:01.190 --> 23:07.070
sotto kurikaesu kagayaki

23:01.190 --> 23:07.070
the repeating, soft shine

23:07.490 --> 23:12.120
warattemo attete

23:07.490 --> 23:12.120
meets and smiles,

23:12.120 --> 23:19.290
mou sukoshide kokoro ga todoku kara

23:12.120 --> 23:19.290
and with just a little more, the hearts have been reached.

23:19.290 --> 23:24.000
toumeina inori de

23:19.290 --> 23:23.880
With a transparent prayer,

23:24.000 --> 23:33.340
yasashiikuchikamu wo tsutsumuyo

23:24.000 --> 23:33.340
concealed within a gentle mouth.

23:35.720 --> 23:38.770
Did you know that pail water is the true form of canned water?

23:38.770 --> 23:40.140
I’m gathering pheromones.

23:40.140 --> 23:40.800
Me too.

23:40.800 --> 23:42.690
It’s troubling if you have too much of them.

23:42.690 --> 23:43.620
Island ferry?

23:43.620 --> 23:47.030
Next episode, episode 5: The Heart that Covers the Light.

23:45.020 --> 23:49.900
The Heart that Covers the Light

23:47.030 --> 23:49.190
I love you, everyone!
